{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-04-15 16:45:00', 'title': 'CENTENE BOARD ISSUES STATEMENT ON DEPARTURE OF BOARD MEMBER', 'text': "ST. LOUIS , APRIL 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CENTENE CORPORATION'S (NYSE: CNC) BOARD OF DIRECTORS ISSUED THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT TODAY: THE CENTENE BOARD HAS ACCEPTED THE RESIGNATION OF LESLIE V. NORWALK, ESQ."}